window.products.push({"id":630005,"name":"Kalsreui Trivets for Hot Dishes, Silicone Trivet Hot Pads for Kitchen Counter, Carved Silicone Trivets for Hot Pots and Pans, Heat Resistant Mat for Q","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pw3wYn0AL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Kalsreui Silicone Trivets for hot dishes Features: 1. Trivets are made of 100% food grade silicone, BPA free . No smell and nontoxic, cyclic use and environmental, will not absorb odors and oil stains.Can be touched food directly, keep you and your family health.  2.Silicone trivet temperature : -22 to 480 degree Fahrenheit.Can be used in microwave, ovens, refrigerators, tabletop, countertop etc.3.The Trivets with Stain and odor resistant, Non-slip texture, Soft feeling, Durable, Flexible, Waterproof, Dishwasher safe  4.Silicone trivetssize: Dia 7.87 Inches, the thicknessis is 0.2 Inches. 5. Package: 6 silicone trivets mats with 3 designs. 6. Trivets Color: Teal7.Easy cleaning: simply hand-wash the silicone trivet or toss it into the dishwasher. 8. Silicone Trivets Functions: Keep your hands safe while handling hot pans, dishes and pots from the oven or stove. Can be used as trivet, table mats, hot pads, placemat, countertop mat, workshop protector, teapot mat, jar opener, table coaster, spoon rest and other you want to use. Protects stove top, table top, workshop or counter top from unsightly burns. 9. These silicone trivets can be as the kitchen decor gadgets, they are the Kitchen accessories you must have. They also can be as a gift for your friends and familly. Notes: 1.Don't heat these trivets directly by fire and don't scratch trivet with sharp things. 2.Do not contact with strong acids and alkalis. 3.There will be a slight odor when it is just opened, and it can be eliminated after just a few hours. Customer Satisfaction: If there is anything that you are not satisfied with our silicone trivets, please contact us freely, we always reply in 24hrs, and we promise to offer our best services for you. Supported by a satisfaction warranty of 60 days.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pw3wYn0AL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kalsreui","source_asin":"B09MFWNHK1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-630005","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MFWNHK1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MFWNHK1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
