window.products.push({"id":630258,"name":"CuteKing Weighted Blanket for Kids (5lbs, 36\"x 48\", Twin, CuteDog) Heavy Blanket for 40-60lbs, Weighted Blanket for Cooling & Heating with Premium Gla","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":37.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Lsrm4sqNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【PREMIUM MATERIAL】 This weighted blanket adopted a unique 7-layer design with precision stitching which prevents the leaking of beads to ensure the glass beads are evenly distributed in each pocket. This sewing process makes the blanket distribute the weight evenly and allows weighted blanket to conform to your body. The breathable heavy blanket is soft, comfortable, and has no odor, perfectly adapted to year-round use. 【NATURAL DEEP SLEEP】 Our weighted blankets provide a natural way to relax and calm your body for a good night's sleep. Stop tossing and turning in bed and boost deep sleep. Perfect weighted blanket for adults has problems with sleeping, sleep deprivation or even more serious conditions. Enjoy soft touch while you are resting, reading, working, watching TV, or enjoying outdoor activities. Great gifts for your loved ones. 【UNIQUE TECHNOLOGY OF GLASS BEADS】 We have observed that for weighted blankets, the biggest problem is that as the beads move in the weighted blanket, the weight becomes more and more uneven. To solve this problem, we double-wrapped threads to make the sewing around the heavy blanket firmer, filled with 0.8-1 mm non-toxic hypo-allergenic glass beads, ensuring that the beads will not enter another area from one area during the use of the blanket. 【RECOMMENDED WEIGHT/SIZE】 We recommend you choose a weighted blanket that weighs 10% of your body weight. If you are never using weighted blankets before, we suggest you choose a lighter one to try first. You may need 2 to 7 days to get used to the weight. For example, 60x80 inches weighted blanket 20 lbs is suitable for adults. This weighted blanket is much smaller than an ordinary blanket. Please refer to our size chart to choose. 【CARE ATTENTION & CUSTOMER SERVICE】 Machine-washable on gentle program in cold water, air dry. Better hand wash. Tumble dry on a low setting or line dry. Use a mild detergent and avoid bleach. If you have any problems with the weighted blanket, please contact us and we will provide customer service 24 hours. The heavy blanket is not recommended under 3 years old and pregnant women, and do not cover your face with the blanket.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Lsrm4sqNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CuteKing","source_asin":"B0BX6KPY2H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-630258","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BX6KPY2H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BX6KPY2H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
