window.products.push({"id":630280,"name":"6 John James #18 Bookbinding Needles","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41g4nF-LWNL._AC_.jpg","description":"6 - John James #18 bookbinding needles. \"Quite simply the best, most perfect bookbinding needle I have ever used for medium sized books. I have bound thousands of books and tried many many types of needles, but these have the perfect balance of a strong shaft (that can be used in place of an awl with a firm grip), small head to avoid making a large hole in the paper and a large enough eye to allow threading without a needle threaded. We looked for a long time until we found these for resale and the WNY Book Arts Center Shop to include in our bookbinding kits.\"  -Richard Kegler, director of WNY Book Arts Center Included are 6 brand new stainless steel needles imported from England. These are made specifically for book binding and not to be confused with other #18 or other manufacturers needles As described by manufacturer John James: Size 18 Bookbinders' needles used for normal sized bindings where text weight papers and thread such as 25/3+ gauge is being used. The smaller the number the thicker the needle. The eye is polished to reduce wear on the sewing thread. All proceeds of this and other ebay sales from this seller go to benefit the programs of the Western New York Book Arts Center.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41g4nF-LWNL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Western New York Book Arts Center","source_asin":"B00D0DLYT0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-630280","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00D0DLYT0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00D0DLYT0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":630281,"name":"Cans Puller Opener - Easy Ring-Pull Cat Food Can Openers - Jar Hook Lid Opener","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51al0Nx8G-S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The hook can opener easily open all ring-pull cans with a gentle lift of the handle. The can opener hook is designed to not have any sharp edges or moving parts and it helps to keep your hands away from the edges of the can lid while you use it! This easy open ring pull can opener is a useful kitchen tool to open cans. This pull ring can opener is a hole on the top of its handle for hanging. The pet food can opener is the perfect addition to any kitchen. This hook opening cans opens ring-pull cans while reducing hand strain with less mess. This pull top can opener is durable, strong, dishwasher safe, easy to clean. This ring pull opener is simple and easy for anyone to use. The cat food can opener is easy to use, insert onto ring tab and pull. This ring puller can opener allows you to quickly open all cans with a ring-pull mechanism, from tuna fish to soup cans and more. This pull top lid opener is dishwasher safe. The can food opener is made of plastic. The jar opener hook is sturdy, durable, and compact for easy storage. This cat food opener is made of premium quality, solid plastic. The ring pull can opener is suitable to use in kitchen, bar, cafe, restaurant and shops.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51al0Nx8G-S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OFXDD","source_asin":"B09645NL6S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-630281","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09645NL6S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09645NL6S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":630282,"name":"Mockins 3 Tier Storage Rack Bookcase Shelf Bundle with 6 Foldable Cube Storage Bins That Perfectly Fit Into The 6 Cube Closet Organizer Cabinet - Blac","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+DYRpji4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you sick and tired of all that clutter just taking up space for no reason? Looking for a simple and easy solution to tidy up and add some style to your room or home? Well with the mockins 3 Tier Storage Rack and 6 Bins you'll be able to organize your home in a jiffy Features: 3 Tier Storage Rack: - Durable and stable construction. Constructed from steel tubes and high quality plastic connectors with waterproof non woven fabric. - Contains 4 pieces of steel tubes in every shelf making it strong and sturdy and has the capacity to hold up to 13 pounds per shelf. - Quick and easy set up. With a simple structure and easy to classify parts you'll have it up in no time! Oh and did we mention no tools? - Use it anywhere around the house from your living area to your kids rooms or closet. - Convenient design. Each shelf has a side shelf to prevent items from falling over. - Use the top of the rack to place items such as a clock, lamp, or flowers. - Each cube in the storage rack is 12 5/8\" X 11 3/4\" X 13 1/8\" - 3 Tiers Rack Net Weight: 5.06 pounds. Storage Cube Bins: - Made from strong non woven fabric. - Complete with a strong handle on the side of the bin for your convenience. - Store a whole variety of different items. - Storage Bin Size: 12 3/5\" X 10 1/5 X 11 4/5\" - Storage Bin Net Weight: 1.12 pounds. We want you to have a clean and clutter free home. If for whatever reason you are not satisfied with your 6 cube storage rack contact us and we will resolve any issues you may have. Organizing made easy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+DYRpji4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mockins","source_asin":"B075FBYLR9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-630282","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075FBYLR9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075FBYLR9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":630283,"name":"LECCECA Nature Leaf Shower Curtain Waterproof Fabric Shower Curtain Liner with Durable Hooks for Bathroom Hotel Home Decoration, 71\" W x 71\" H","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61D4T0hJDNL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"LECCECA natural theme shower curtain, green leaves in ink painting, classical colors in the curtains are match with any style of bathroom and your existing decor, create a comfortable bathing environment and let you enjoy the personal bathing time and have a good relax. Features: 1. Premium quality, made of eco-friendly, waterproof and no-see-through fabric- unless using under the bright light, it will look translucent; can be use as a shower curtain or shower curtain liner. 2. Durable fabric allows for easy cleaning and caring, it can be wiped with cloth after shower; Perfect Size -- 71*71 inches -- perfect for most bathtubs and shower spaces. 3. Cute and chic patterns are printed with the excellent printing technology, not fade easily. It will be a great decoration for your bathroom or other space. 4. Included 12 pcs flexible and durable plastic hooks for easy installation and gliding over the rod. 5. Machine washable, wash cold by gentle cycle, color separated washing, tumble dry low, iron if needed low heat, do not bleach. Package includes: 1 x Shower Curtain 12 x Plastic Hooks Note: 1. There are some folding marks due to the package at the first use, thus, please iron it on low heat if necessary. 2. Please allow little color difference due to the monitor and light brightness. 3. Please allow 0.3’’-0.9\" size error due to manual measurement. 4. If you want to know more information with these shower curtains or have any question about this product, please feel free to email us, we will give you a swift and satisfactory reply.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61D4T0hJDNL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LECCECA","source_asin":"B07R46T6TK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-630283","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07R46T6TK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07R46T6TK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
