window.products.push({"id":630309,"name":"28-Piece Unbreakable Wheat Straw Dinnerware Set - Lightweight, Microwave & Dishwasher Safe - Perfect for Camping, Picnics & Everyday Use","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610zVg4g0zL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Upgrade your dining experience with our 28-piece unbreakable wheat straw dinnerware set! Made from high-quality wheat straw fiber, our eco-friendly and durable set is perfect for anyone looking to reduce their plastic waste. Our unbreakable dinnerware set comes with 4 pieces each of dinner plates, dessert plates, cereal bowls, cups, forks, spoons, and knives - everything you need to enjoy your favorite meals. One of the best features of our wheat straw dinnerware set is its toughness. Despite its lightweight design, this dinnerware set can withstand heavy use and even accidental drops, making it perfect for families with children or for outdoor use during picnics or camping trips. Our unbreakable dinnerware set is also very versatile. It can withstand temperatures of up to 248°F (120°C), which means it can be used to serve both hot and cold food and beverages. Whether you are serving soup, salad, or ice cream, our wheat straw dishes are up to the task. What's more, they are dishwasher, freezer, and microwave safe, making them convenient for everyday use. At our company, we care deeply about the environment, which is why we have created this wheat straw dinnerware set. Unlike traditional plastic dinnerware, our wheat straw plates and bowls are made of sustainable, renewable materials that do not harm the planet. Our unbreakable plates and bowls sets are reusable, which means you won't have to keep buying new dinnerware, further reducing plastic waste. Lastly, our wheat straw dishes are safe for the whole family to use. They do not contain any BPAs or melamine, and do not give off any overpowering odors, making them perfect for those with sensitive noses.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610zVg4g0zL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DE’CRUXSWAY - Life to the next level of essence","source_asin":"B0BPBJ2QDK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-630309","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPBJ2QDK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BPBJ2QDK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
