window.products.push({"id":630330,"name":"INSE Cordless Vacuum Cleaner, 25Kpa 300W Powerful Stick Vacuum, 6-in-1 Rechargeable Vacuum with 2500m-Ah Battery Up to 45mins Runtime, Lightweight Vac","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":129.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61o8pNXmWML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Ultra-quiet丨Super Powerful】Due to no friction of any carbon brush, S610’s cordless vacuum upgraded high-power 300W brushless motor generates much less heat and less noise (65db), which results in more energy-saving and longer service life (10 years), compared with other regular brushed motors. The vacuum cleaner cordless 120,000 rpm fan speed delivers super-strong fade-free suction power even when the battery is low. 【Removable Battery丨Longer Runtime】Cordless vacuum cleaners adopt an 8-cell lithium-ion battery, with 2500m-Ah of the capacity of each cell, which not only provides strong power but also provides a longer working time and a longer battery life than Dyxon cordless stick vacuum so that it can offer a whole-house cleaning. Stick Vacuum with the easy-to-charge removable and replaceable battery. 35-45 minutes in standard mode 13Kpa, 12-20 minutes in max mode 25Kpa. 【Versatile丨Lightweight】INSE cordless vacuum cleaner with a light body, brush tool, or crevice tool can be attached to a retractable tube to clean the dust on the ceiling or curtains, and the stick vacuum cleaner cordless can be switched into a handheld vacuum to pick up debris on the table or in the gap between the car's seats; you can also attach the cleaner head to the main motor to clean the stairs with ease. Stick vacuum one button quickly to empty the 1.2L extra-large du-st cup without touching the dirt. 【Upgraded High-efficiency HEPA Filter】Pet hair vacuum with a 5-stage fully sealed cyclone filtration system captures 99.99% of dust particles as small as 0.1micro, such as pollen, pet dander, hair, etc. With both a high-efficiency HEPA filter and a high-density mesh filter combined, the whole filtration performance is 2x that of the normal filter. This can extend the life of the machine, expel purified air, and avoid secondary pollution by preventing the motor from being blocked by microdust. 【LED Headlights丨Flexible Floor Brush】A motorized cleaner head with bright LED headlights provides a clear view of crumbs on the kitchen floor, and dirt under the bed, couch, and furniture allowing you to clean more effectively in dark areas. A flexible 150° swivel sideways and 90° up and down make your whole-house cleaning easier and faster. One-handed operation is effortless thanks to the lightweight design. For pet-loving family members or friends, this cordless stick vacuum cleaner is the perfect gift. 【Compact Storage | No-worry Service】The vacuum cordless has two ways to store it: wall-hanging and self-standing. Please Note: The HEPA filter can't be washed, you can clean it with a cleaning gadget. The wireless vacuum cleaner that you order from our store comes with a 12-month 100% satisfaction after-sales service and 24x7 online customer service. We're always happy to help if there are any concerns.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61o8pNXmWML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"INSE","source_asin":"B0BFQZGVXR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-630330","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BFQZGVXR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BFQZGVXR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
