window.products.push({"id":630485,"name":"Leather Recipe Binder 10.5\"x12.5\" with Recipe Cards 5.7\"x8\" & Plastic Protectors& Dividers with tabs, 1.5 inch 3 Ring Binder Recipes Organizer Kit to ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710PgwZ-b3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ALL IN ONE - large recipe binder, 1.5 inch 3 ring binder, 30 pcs plastic protectors, 30 pcs thick recipe cards, 6 different colors dividers with tabs. All these are packaged in a CAGIE gift box. LARGE & WATERPROOF - Our recipe binder is designed in 10.5\" x 12.5'' and made of quality PU leather, which not only have a vintage look but also protect your recipes from grease and water stains. Cleaning is done with a light wipe, which makes the recipe binder more durable. MORE WRITING SPACE - Our exclusively designed recipe cards measure 5.7'' x 8'' (14.5x20.5cm), the same size as an A5 notebook. The cards is thick enough to write on both sides, this provides you with more writing area to help you record every step of the recipe in its entirety, making your cooking more flawless. PROTECTION & CLASSIFICATION - 30 pcs plastic protector sheets are made thick enough to avoid being ripped or torn, you can easily read recipes through clear sheets and organize your recipes with the tab dividers that stick out past the sheets to quickly find each category. MEANINGFUL GIFT & PERSONALIZED KEEPSAKE - Our recipe binder has a comfortable feel of leather cover and a vintage appearance and it can stand upright on the table, which is sure to be a beautiful sight in your kitchen. Also will be a great gift for them as a wedding/ anniversary/ birthday/ Christmas gift and so on.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710PgwZ-b3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CAGIE","source_asin":"B0BFX1T7P8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-630485","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BFX1T7P8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BFX1T7P8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
