window.products.push({"id":630561,"name":"Bush Furniture Cabot Desk with Hutch | Corner with Storage for Home Office | L Shaped Computer, 60W, Modern Gray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":515.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RrfON+F7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Introducing the Bush Furniture Key West Secretary Desk - a work desk and accent cabinet with doors that offers versatility, style, and functionality. This compact desk is an ideal solution for those who need a work desk but have limited space. It serves as a central location for your laptop and can be used as a casual storage solution in any room. This desk features a convenient pull-out keyboard tray with a flip-down front that folds up neatly when not in use, complete with wire management for a clean workspace. The drawer opens on full-extension ball bearing slides, providing easy access to contents and ensuring reliable everyday use. The built-in storage cabinet comes with one adjustable shelf to help you organize your work materials and supplies of various sizes. With unique X pattern accents on the door panels, this armoire-style desk has a relaxed style and a sturdy post-leg design that complements any farmhouse or coastal decor. Aged bronze hardware adds a touch of elegance to the desk's overall design, which is available in your choice of several finishes. Personalize your workspace with coordinating desktop organizers (sold separately) to keep everything in its place. This desk is tested to meet ANSI/SOHO quality standards for safety and performance and is backed by the Bush Furniture 1-year manufacturer's warranty. Moreover, the Bush Furniture Key West Secretary Desk is not just a desk but also a printer cabinet and desk cabinet that can fit in any small space. It is a small desk with storage that can help you organize your work materials and supplies. Invest in the Bush Furniture Key West Secretary Desk with Keyboard Tray and Storage Cabinet today, and experience a seamless blend of style and functionality.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RrfON+F7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bush Furniture","source_asin":"B08MSZT4R9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-630561","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08MSZT4R9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08MSZT4R9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
