window.products.push({"id":630634,"name":"Santoku Knife , LongQuan Knife Series, Sharp Chopping Knife forged in fire, Cooking Knife with Ergonomic Handle for Kitchen and Restaurant","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dk5EZFBoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🔪 Longquan knives originate from Longquan, the city of swordsmithing for thousands of years, and its forging skills are selected as national intangible cultural heritage. A Longquan knife goes through 28 core processes from raw materials to finished products, inheriting the manufacturing process of Longquan swords, which are continuously forged by hand through layers of processes. 💧The meaning of the word ‘Santoku’ clearly explains what it is best used for: the ‘three virtues’ or ‘three uses’ of chopping, dicing and mincing. It handles all of these jobs in exemplary fashion but avoids chopping large meat bones, slicing bread, and precision tasks (such as peeling). Santoku knives are particularly adept at creating very thin slices of foods, which improves the overall aesthetics of completed dishes. 💎Premium steel: This santoku knife selected high carbon stainless steel, hand-forged, higher density and hardness, with a little polishing after the dull can become as sharp as before, high durability. ⚒️ Ergonomic Handle:The handle of this santoku knife is made of natural pear wood, which is non-slip and comfortable to hold. The brass clip connects the blade to the handle, and the reinforced rivets at the end of the handle make the knife stronger and less prone to breakage. 📃Guarantee: We provide 100% satisfaction or money back guarantee service, which helps you bear the risk of trial. We guarantee to provide high-quality products with gift boxes, which is the best choice for your Christmas and New Year gift.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dk5EZFBoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BLADESMITH","source_asin":"B09K5HGKH5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-630634","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09K5HGKH5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09K5HGKH5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":630635,"name":"Calypso Basics by Reston Lloyd Enamel Stock Pot with Glass Lid, 3.5 quart, Red/White Marble,57960","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91SyMt7sNdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Enamel on steel cookware has been around for a long time and there is a reason why, it works. This heavy gauge carbon steel is covered with a porcelain finish which allows for even heat distributions and is versatile for any cooking range top. The stock pot is constructed with custom handles from Germany to ensure a comfortable feel and ability to handle the weight of a full stock pot. The handles are seamlessly molded into the construction to allow for a beautiful feel and look. Heat tempered glass was used for the lid to allow you to check on your cooking project while on the stove. Enjoy cooking with quality and have fun with our fun color stockpots.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91SyMt7sNdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Reston Lloyd","source_asin":"B00WO5PLAI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-630635","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00WO5PLAI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00WO5PLAI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
