window.products.push({"id":630664,"name":"Naturoom Sofa Armrest Organizer, Non-Slip Couch Caddy Armchair Arm Chair Caddy with 6 Pockets Armchair Caddy forSmart Phone, Book, Magazines, Ipad, TV","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ikb2c-5yL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Still looking for the lost TV remote control ? - \"Where's that darned remote?\", \"Where's my Kindle?\", \"Where's my... (well, you get it, lol) We have the solution! Organize your living room with our remote control holder and keep your remote, ipad or smart phone always in reach with this armchair caddy. Non Slip Design - The back of the sofa armrest organizer adds a non-slip design. which is perfect because the non-slip pellets adhere to the back of the armrests. It can also be used on a recliner without a lift cushion and doesn’t scratch or leave marks on the wood, like the competitive products with hooks would. Lager Size & More Pocket - Our couch remote caddy is made of wrinkle resistant high quality linen. Measures L35\"xW14\", fits most couches, reclining chair, or as a bedside caddy. Has 6 pockets, 2 big, 4 small. Accommodate more stuff. Perfect fit for your comfort. Easy to Install - Place the end with the organizer inside and underneath your couch cushions to secure the organizer in place.If it’s too long and you can roll up the end side of the organizer accordingly then put it under the seat. Best Of All, you automatically get our \"No Hassle\" 365 Days Naturoom couch caddy guarantee! We promise you that our covers are made from the best quality materials. If you are not 100% Satisfied, Just contact us and we will refund or replace, NO QUESTIONS ASKED.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ikb2c-5yL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Naturoom","source_asin":"B08KPWC9LQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-630664","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KPWC9LQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KPWC9LQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":630665,"name":"Excellanté Mica Black Collection 20-Inch Round Plate, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.06,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61m2nxsWjyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Excellanté white 20inch round plate. The glossy style and rich design will add elegance and class to any dining table. The 20-Inch round plate is great for holding large portions of food to eat off of. It is perfect for any restaurant, household, catering, party, or special event. This product is molded out of 100-Percent melamine, non-toxic, dishwasher safe, and National Sanitation Foundation (NSF) approved. However, it is not for microwave or oven use. Furthermore, our melamine products are break and scratch resistant and are heat resistant up to 212 degrees fahrenheit/100 degrees Celsius.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61m2nxsWjyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Excellant","source_asin":"B0034B7T42","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-630665","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0034B7T42","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0034B7T42","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
