window.products.push({"id":630685,"name":"Digital Coffee Scales Timer and Tare Function 6.6lb/3kg Built-in Kitchen Scale for Cooking Baking with LCD Display (Green Light)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jLPj6jtNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A coffee scale will change the way you brew coffee. Your brew will be tastier, more balanced, and reliably delicious every single morning. ★Without a scale, you have no way of knowing whether you’re in this range or not. But with a scale, achieving that balance is simple, painless, and takes no time at all.HuiSmart scale with timer is perfect for kitchen and pour over coffee making, fit most of your need. ★Weighing your beans isn’t the only important step to making great coffee, timing the pour matters tool. The timer function comes in very handy when pulling shots (and even timing an entire coffee routine). It's more convenient and less messy than using a cell phone timer around the counter. ★The right window reads input weight so, having tared the scales after adding the dose of coffee grinds, you can add a precise measured amount of water in grams. The left window reads time elapsed so you can keep track of your total brew time. Specifications Weight: 490g(tray and coffee cup mat are included)  Large Capacity: 3KG/6.6LB   Auto power off:4 mins Item Size: 200*117*30 mm   Weight Capacity: A: 2-200g d=0.1g B:200-500g d=0.5g C:500-3000g d=1g   Weighing Units: oz, lb, g, g/ml, ml Warm Tips: * Don't put the product in water or clean it with corrosive chemicals.   * When weighing, please put the scale on a hard flat surface to ensure accurately measure weight.  * Make sure the display track to zero, then start your weighing. Package Content 1x Electronic Coffee Scale    1x Tray   1x Coffee cup mat   2x 1.5V AAA Batteries    1x Using manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jLPj6jtNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HuiSmart","source_asin":"B07S1MBW5W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-630685","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07S1MBW5W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07S1MBW5W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
