window.products.push({"id":630698,"name":"CozyNest LED Lighted Bathroom Mirror 32''x24'' Anti-Fog,Dimmable Touch Switch Control IP44 Waterproof,Explosion-Proof CRI 90+ (Vertical/Horizontal)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71x-kJyseDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Dimmable Feature - With a built-in dimming feature, you can always increase or decrease the luminosity of the bulbs and adjust the brightness according to your preferred level so that you can not only see your face in suitable light but also ensure a soothing and calming vibe to your eyes.The mirror also produces high-quality task lights that are perfect for putting on your makeup, while the smart memory function will remember your favorite setting. Anti Fog - A defogger not only resists fog build-up on the mirror surface but also keeps the mirror sparkling clean so that you don’t have to wipe it after every shower to see your face perfectly. Explosion-Proof Silver Mirror with Aluminum Alloy Frame, Suitable for Living Room/Hotel/Corridor Sophisticated Design - Frame-less mirrors are common in bathrooms because they are easy to clean and give bathrooms a modern look.Color Rendering Index or CRI>90 helps the mirror be able to accurately reproduce the colors of the object it illuminates,making the images clearly and vividly. Superior Lifespan with Energy Saving - The silver coating reflects light better than any other material for a clearer image and featured with glass stronger, provides higher heat absorption level and corrosion resistance and ensures exceptional durability. The average LED has a lifespan of roughly 50,000 hours, cost roughly 1/6 that of a traditional bulb.Our LED mirrors feature waterproof and moisture-proof backing, IP54 rate to ensure safe lighting in wet bathroom environments Updated Packing - We customize packaging by wrapping in double-layer carton packaging that has more than 1-inch foam and pearl wool according to the size while keeping fragility of the product in mind. So that the mirror can be safe from any dropping, impact, and heavy pressure for safe transportation. . Screw mount included.UL Certified; 1 Year Warranty","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71x-kJyseDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CozyNest","source_asin":"B08TZNTXTH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-630698","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08TZNTXTH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08TZNTXTH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
