window.products.push({"id":630707,"name":"Seabreeze SOH3003T Heat Sweep ThermaFlo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/419C4zcsBKL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description The 1500-watt Heat Sweep, equipped with revolutionary ThermaFlo technology, incorporates a patented design to sweep a curtain of comfort across the room up to 45 times per minute. This pulse action raises the temperature of an average size room 14 degrees F in just 30 minutes. In addition, ThermaFlo technology synchronizes the fan speed of the motor with heat output. Once in ThermaFlo (1000-watt) mode, the heater operates in a whisper-quiet mode, while saving energy (up to 18%!) and delivering more intense heat. Amazon.com With its 1500-watt motor and 5120 BTUs of heat, the Seabreeze Heat Sweep can quickly raise the temperature of a room or maintain it for ideal comfort. The heater comes with 2 power speeds--1000 watts and 1500 watts--and a range of temperature settings. You can use the settings in conjunction to tailor room heat to a preference or keep the unit set on the Freezeguard feature to prevent unused rooms from freezing. Oscillating louvers help distribute warm air no matter the setting, sweeping across a room up to 45 times per minute. Virtually silent on its lowest setting, the heater emits a low, unobtrusive whir on high. Its safety features include a cool-touch cabinet, a manual reset cut-off device, a back-up heat fuse, and a power indicator light. Covered by a two-year warranty, it measures 10.8 x 9.8 x 8.6 inches and includes built-in storage hooks for the cord. --Emily Bedard","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/419C4zcsBKL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Seabreeze","source_asin":"B0000SW028","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-630707","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000SW028","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000SW028","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
