window.products.push({"id":630814,"name":"16 Pcs Chinese Lucky Coins Decorations Feng Shui Coins Ornaments Hanging Good Fortune Coins Ornaments Red Chinese Knot Luck Charm and fu Bags for Weal","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1pUGkexcCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Quantity:16 Pcs Chinese Lucky Coins Feng Shui Tassel Good Fortune Coin with Red Chinese Knot Tassel and 4 Pcs fu Bags. Material: Five Coins portion is made of copper metal. Chinese Knot Tassel portion is made of polyester Size:Total Length of Chinese Lucky Coins Knot Tassel :14 inch,35.5cm.Chinese fu bags is 7.3\" LX 4.7\" W. The five coins invoke the five \"Emperors of the Universe\" for protection against danger and harm as well as to attract wealth luck. The five coins also signify the five feng shui elements (metal, wood, water, fire and earth) for a balanced and harmonious life. The coins are tied in a red string and a mystic knot to empower its energy. For many centuries, Chinese coins have been a very desirable symbol, signifying prosperity and owning many riches. The Chinese coin itself has an interesting design and depiction; because it is round, with a square-shaped hole in the center, it is said to be a representation of earth surrounded by heaven. It is for this reason that, when utilized by humans, they are an emblem of the harmony of the “Heaven-Earth-Man”.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1pUGkexcCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Supla","source_asin":"B07YTH1HGN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-630814","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YTH1HGN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YTH1HGN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
