window.products.push({"id":630892,"name":"Simply Eco Stainless Steel Reusable Metal Straws.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OzCCkh9JL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Safe, non-toxic and durable material, no metallic aftertaste, bpa free. These drinking metal straws are made of food-grade stainless steel 18/8, making them rust resistant, corrosion resistant, and scratch-proof. They are durable and never going to get broken. The metal straws have smooth finish without any sharp edges to make them safer and comfortable for the mouth. Easy to clean, these reusable metal straws are dishwasher safe. Each set includes 1 long cleaning brush to make sure you’re getting any stuck-on bits off the inner walls. Our stainless steel straws resist high temperatures and can be sterilized. Versatile and portable metal straws with 8.5\" lenght is the perfect size for all 20 oz tumblers cups. You can carry one with you in the cloth bag you select. The diameter is 6 mm that makes them good for your favorite beverages like water, juice, coffee, tea or your cherished starbucks drink. Long enough for 20 oz yeti, rtic and ozark tumblers. Each pack comes with 4 drinking straws (2 straight and 2 ergonomically bent straws) that can be put in mason jars, cups or travel mugs. Save the nature. Eco-friendly solution to replace disposable plastic straws. Our reusable straws can be used over and over again. Make the change from disposable plastic straws to sustainable stainless steel drinking straws and you will be proud to help the environment and protect the sea life, reducing the plastic waste. It will be economical and healthier for your family. The perfect gift for your mom, daughter, grandmother, son, sister, friend or co-worker. Take action to help the environment together.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OzCCkh9JL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Simply Eco","source_asin":"B07L8W8JW6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-630892","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07L8W8JW6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07L8W8JW6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
