window.products.push({"id":630980,"name":"CAMECO Ozone Machine 40,000mg/h Dual Mode, Professional O3 Ozone Deodorizer with Booster Pump, 20,000mg & 20,000mg & 500mg 3 Timers, 7000sqft, Ideal f","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":269.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XLSQ0I1mL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Do you know how ozone work? Ozone is effective for bad smells and replace them with a neutral smell. Ozone (O₃) contains three atoms of oxygen instead of the O₂ you breathe. The third oxygen atom makes ozone extremely reactive and attaches itself to other molecules. When pollutants meet ozone, oxidation occurs and both parties are destroyed, while the O₃ essentially reverts back to O₂ you can breathe. What's ozone? Ozone is one of nature’s most powerful oxidants Ozone is also called active oxygen. It has strong oxidizing properties, and it is a wide and efficient way to improve air quality. Ozone can be converted into oxygen at a certain concentration, without any residue, and no secondary pollution will be formed. Ozone is also called active oxygen. It has strong oxidizing properties, and it is a wide and efficient way to improve air quality. Ozone can be converted into oxygen at a certain concentration, without any residue, and no secondary pollution will be formed. Ozone exists in the atmosphere to protect human beings from the sunlight. That fresh, clean smell after a thunderstorm? That’s ozone too. Ozone exists in the atmosphere to protect human beings from the sunlight. That fresh, clean smell after a thunderstorm? That’s ozone too. Why you need an ozone machine? Ozone can be released to the entire space and the surface of objects without obstruction & dead ends. Ozone can be released to the entire space and the surface of objects without obstruction & dead ends. No consumables, no need to replace parts repeatedly, as long as there is air, ozone can be produced. No consumables, no need to replace parts repeatedly, as long as there is air, ozone can be produced. Ozone with uniform diffusion & better permeability, which overcomes the problem of purification dead angles of other purification equipment, quickly & efficiently removing odors in all directions. Ozone with uniform diffusion & better permeability, which overcomes the problem of purification dead angles of other purification equipment, quickly & efficiently removing odors in all directions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XLSQ0I1mL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CAMECO","source_asin":"B0BX26L2B7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-630980","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BX26L2B7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BX26L2B7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
